  "notes": "Title: Quadruple S-R latches. Two boxes, each standing for two latches; every pin also carries a second number in brackets for the other latch of that kind: upper box 6 (15), 7 (13), 5 (14); lower box 2 (11), 3 (12), 4 (9), 1 (10). The lower box has no 'S' printed inside at the top, only 'R' at the bottom. In the lower box pin 2 is a shorter line near the left corner of the top side and pin 3 a longer line further right."
